  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Large scale PV solar power-plant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This is a blending operation (70million euros loan from AFD and 2million euros grant from the EU) for the&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;construction of a 200MW solar photovoltaic park in Jigawa Solar park with three components:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- The development of a solar power plant with a capacity of up to 200 MW, via 4 clusters of 50 MW.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- The development of electrical energy storage facilities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Transmission and/or distribution network, and the construction of medium or high voltage lines. This&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;component includes the possible upgrading of two substations. The component also includes the&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;construction of Medium Voltage or High Voltage lines, for a 33 kV line and a 132 kV line).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
